      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Chess Clock\n\nAn offline two-player chess clock with five minutes per player. Tap or keyboard-activate a clock to give that side the turn; the selected clock counts down while the other stays still. Use Pause to pause or resume. When a clock reaches zero, the app shows “Flag!” and disables both clocks.\n\n## Run\n\nOpen `index.html` in a modern browser. No server, packages, network access, or external assets are needed.\n\n## Build evidence\n\nThe app consists of one HTML page, one local stylesheet, and one plain JavaScript file. The clock initializes both players at 5:00, formats times as m:ss, supports labeled keyboard-accessible buttons, and uses responsive layout rules suitable for narrow screens including 360px widths.\n",
